OL,5,G1300 Classical Live
OL,6,     FLinton Stephens introduces
OL,7,     Fhighlights from the BBC Proms,
OL,8,     Fincluding Szymanowski's choral
OL,9,     Fmasterpiece, his Stabat mater;
OL,10,     Fplus chamber music from the recent
OL,11,     FAldeburgh Festival.
OL,12,G1600 Composer of the Week: Alice Smith
OL,13,     F4/5. Donald Macleod traces Smith's
OL,14,     Fwriting of her Second Symphony for
OL,15,     Fa competition at the Alexandra
OL,16,     FPalace.
OL,17,G1700 In Tune
OL,18,     FConnor Fogel and tenor Brenden
OL,19,     FGunnell on their latest albums.
