OL,5,G2330 'Round Midnight
OL,6,     FSoweto is joined by his final
OL,7,     FJazzahead guest of the week,
OL,8,     FHungarian producer and
OL,9,     Fmulti-instrumentalist Abase,
OL,10,     Frecorded backstage in Bremen
OL,11,     Fearlier this year.
OL,12,G0030 Through the Night
OL,13,     FThe Amaryllis Quartet has been
OL,14,     Fperforming in major concert halls
OL,15,     Ffor 20 years. In this birthday
OL,16,     Fconcert, chamber music classics by
OL,17,     FBeethoven and Brahms are
OL,18,     Fperformed.
